Z||000022||Ken Wittlief||08-27-2001||09:04 AM||||Hey Bill - when I was in boot camp in the Coast Guard, the 4 tallest guys marched in front of the company, and we marched in decending order of height, with the shortest people in the back.<P>I was the tallest guy in our company - it was fun cause we would always hear this one girl, about 4'9" yelling from the back "SLOW DOWN" - she could not keep up with our stride and stay in step at the same time - sometimes we delebrately took huge steps just to have fun with the guys in the back.<P>  But the shortest guy, he marched out in front of us, and carried the company flag.<P> were you the shortest guy in your group?||||reg||11
